This extension is a client of the separate Web Scraper service
(web-scraper-service). It contains no third-party code; its only runtime
dependency is the Flow Steward extension SDK, which the platform provides.

The scraper service, installed and released separately, is built on:
- Crawlee for Python, browserforge, impit (Apache-2.0)
- apify-actor-docker base images (Apache-2.0)
- Camoufox Python package (MIT); the Camoufox browser (MPL-2.0), used
  unmodified as a separate program, including its cursor-humanising
  component (LGPL-3.0), used unmodified inside the browser
- extruct (BSD-3-Clause)
See the service's own NOTICE for its complete list.

Proxy and challenge-solver providers named in the profile presets (Oxylabs,
Bright Data, Decodo, CapSolver, 2Captcha, Anti-Captcha,
